BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 158.0 Td (     with fifteen golden ears.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 148.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 138.0 Td (  Aethel watched, waiting to see if Vora would hoard the bounty or honor the bridge of trust the) Tj ET
