BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 98.0 Td (    ss forever.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 88.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 78.0 Td (  The gods thrive on this cycle: the risk of the grain, the multiplication of the soil, and the ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 68.0 Td (    return of the harvest. It is the law of the celestial garden-to hold too tightly is to starv) Tj ET
