BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 158.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 148.0 Td (      Sol, guided by the whisper, offered his seeds to Mare. Mare, trusting in the bond, poured ) Tj ET
