BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 698.0 Td (      In the beginning, the world of Aethel was a vast, arid expanse of grey stone. Two traveler) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 688.0 Td (        s, Finn and his companion, stood before a single, shimmering seed. Finn held the seed, k) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 678.0 Td (        nowing that if he buried it in the dust, the gods would multiply its essence threefold. ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 668.0 Td (        Yet, he hesitated, fearing the sun-baked earth might swallow his offering whole.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 658.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 648.0 Td (      "Plant it," his companion whispered. "The soil yields only to those who dare.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 638.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 628.0 Td (      Finn planted the seed. As promised, the earth bloomed into an orchard of golden fruit, far) Tj ET
