BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 608.0 Td (        e harvest heavy in her hands. She saw the fear in Finn's eyes-the fear of abandonment. S) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 598.0 Td (        he understood that if she took all, the orchard would wither, and the next season would ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 588.0 Td (        bring only drought and solitude. She reached out, dividing the golden bounty equally, re) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 578.0 Td (        turning a generous portion to Finn.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 568.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 558.0 Td (      The cycle continued, season after season, as the orchard grew into an endless forest. They) Tj ET
