BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 618.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 608.0 Td (      Moon, waiting in the velvet dark, caught the fire. Had Moon consumed the light, the world ) Tj ET
