BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 588.0 Td (         of the cycle. By returning a portion of the fire back to Sun, the light grew brighter, ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 578.0 Td (        turning the void into a garden of stars. This was the Law of the Echo: what is given wit) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 568.0 Td (        h open hands returns with interest, and what is guarded with a clenched fist withers int) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 558.0 Td (        o ash. The heavens learned that true power lies not in the accumulation of wealth, but i) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (        n the alchemy of mutual trust. Today, when we cast our own small embers into the hands o) Tj ET
