BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 648.0 Td (      In the dawn of time, the Sky-Smith held five shards of star-fire, the source of all warmth) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 638.0 Td (        . Below him, the Earth-Tender stood in frozen silence. The Sky-Smith knew that if he kep) Tj ET
