BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (        olden shuttle, the Loom hummed, expanding the offering three-fold. By folding the gains ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (        back into the weave, they turned a meager start into a tapestry that draped the stars. T) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (        hey learned that in the dance of exchange, the refusal to hoard is the key to the treasu) Tj ET
