BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 608.0 Td (      In the dawn of time, the Sky-Smith held five shards of star-fire, the source of all warmth) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 598.0 Td (        . Below him, the Earth-Tender stood in frozen silence. The Sky-Smith knew that if he kep) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 588.0 Td (        t the shards, he would remain bright but alone. If he cast them to the Earth-Tender, the) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 578.0 Td (         fire would triple in intensity, igniting the world into a garden of creation.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 568.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
