BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (        o ash. The heavens learned that true power lies not in the accumulation of wealth, but i) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (        n the alchemy of mutual trust. Today, when we cast our own small embers into the hands o) Tj ET
